OL,3,AExplosion on Russian ship at Libya port
OL,4,Acaused by suspected drone attack,
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn explosion on a Russian ship docked
OL,8,Fat Benghazi naval base port was caused
OL,9,Fby a suspected drone attack, Libya's
OL,10,Feastern government has said.
OL,12,FThe explosion happened at dawn on
OL,13,FSunday, while the ship had stopped for
OL,14,Ffuel and supplies on its way back to
OL,15,FRussia, Libyan state media reported,
OL,16,Fciting the eastern government.
OL,18,FIt added that the site was secured, and
OL,19,Fthere were no casualties. Moscow has
OL,20,Fyet to comment.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
