OL,3,AExplosion on Russian ship at Libya port
OL,4,Acaused by suspected drone attack,
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FSatellite imagery from Planet Labs PBC,
OL,8,Freviewed by BBC Verify, shows a boat on
OL,9,Ffire at 0547 GMT at the Benghazi port,
OL,10,Fwith a separate image captured several
OL,11,Fhours later appearing to show the same
OL,12,Fvessel partially submerged.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
